  "bodyHash": "ed45b34b66106c70",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163669493-e9100ac8-b091-4a64-bc5c-ca5915c8006b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">預測玩家移動方向，並異步預載其前方區域的區塊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">整體略微提升區塊載入速度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過智慧調整載入範圍來配合玩家移動速度，控制原版玩家周圍的區塊載入機制，進而降低伺服器負擔</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;需安裝<strong>Cupboard</strong>相依模組&nbsp;</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">設定預測範圍的大小與距離</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">設定移動中玩家周圍區塊載入範圍的調整幅度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可單獨啟用或停用各項功能</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">僅限伺服器端使用</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前已知無相容性問題</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
